    "name": "IR4 Platform API",
    "description": "REST/JSON surfaces for IR4 (DOC-01 / DOC-02 / DOC-08 / DOC-13 / DOC-23).\n\n**Three entry surfaces**\n- **A. Operator JSON helpers** — session cookie (Fortify). Poll fallbacks for live screens.\n- **B. Device API** — `X-Device-Token` header. `/api/ingest/*`, heartbeat, edge ROI pull.\n- **C. Public** — unauthenticated LAN QR page (read-only).\n- **Mobile** — Sanctum Bearer token under `/api/mobile/*` (operator app; not device auth).\n\nSuccess envelope (most endpoints): `{ \"data\": { … } }`\nIngest batch response (202): `{ \"accepted\", \"duplicates\", \"rejected\": [] }`\nErrors: `{ \"error\": { \"code\", \"message\", \"details?\" } }`",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
