    {
      "name": "Device API (auth.device)",
      "description": "Surface B — DOC-02 / DOC-08 / DOC-23.\n\nHeader: `X-Device-Token: <plain token>` (shown once when the device is created/rotated in Hardware settings).\n\nDevice-scoped routes use path `{deviceUuid}` + matching token (heartbeat, camera-rois) — same pattern.\nIngest body shape: `{ \"events\": [ … ] }` (max `ingest.max_batch`, default 1000).\nResponse: **202 Accepted** with per-event outcomes — never all-or-nothing.\n\nDemo defaults: `deviceUuid` / `deviceToken` = DEV-CAM-FIXED-01; `cameraRef` = CAM-FIXED-01.\nHeadcount ingest also needs the camera bound under Settings → Repositioning (or run `php scripts/mimic_headcount_edge.php`).",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Heartbeat",
          "item": [
            {
              "name": "POST /api/devices/{device}/heartbeat",
              "request": {
                "method": "POST",
                "header": [
                  {
                    "key": "Accept",
                    "value": "application/json"
                  },
                  {
                    "key": "Content-Type",
                    "value": "application/json"
                  },
                  {
                    "key": "X-Device-Token",
                    "value": "{{deviceToken}}"
                  }
                ],
                "body": {
                  "mode": "raw",
                  "raw": "{\n  \"status\": \"online\",\n  \"meta\": {\n    \"firmware\": \"1.0.0\"\n  }\n}"
                },
                "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/devices/{{deviceUuid}}/heartbeat",
                "description": "Liveness ping (DOC-05). `{device}` is the device **UUID** (route key), not the integer id.\n\nOptional body: `status` (`online`|`offline`|`degraded`|`fault`|`maintenance`), `meta` (object, merged into `devices.config`).\nToken must belong to this device or 403. Empty body is also valid."
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Camera ROIs",
          "item": [
            {
              "name": "GET /api/devices/{device}/camera-rois",
              "request": {
                "method": "GET",
                "header": [
                  {
                    "key": "Accept",
                    "value": "application/json"
                  },
                  {
                    "key": "X-Device-Token",
                    "value": "{{deviceToken}}"
                  }
                ],
                "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/devices/{{deviceUuid}}/camera-rois",
                "description": "Pull **active** ROI polygons for this camera **device** (DOC-23).\n\nSame auth as heartbeat: `GET /api/devices/{deviceUuid}/camera-rois` + `X-Device-Token` (must match).\nThe device is the camera unit (1:1). Response = `device` + `rois` only (no cameras list).\n\n**Example:**\n\n```json\n{\n  \"data\": {\n    \"device\": {\n      \"id\": 3,\n      \"uuid\": \"7cd2d9bc-4986-4c07-9cd8-631a2eb66b02\",\n      \"reference\": \"DEV-CAM-FIXED-01\",\n      \"name\": \"Pole 01 Fixed Camera\"\n    },\n    \"view_fingerprint\": \"9f86d081884c7d659a2feaa0c55ad015a3bf4f1b2b0b822cd15d6c15b0f00a08\",\n    \"published_at\": \"2026-08-25T18:00:00+00:00\",\n    \"rois\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Bay floor\",\n        \"reference\": \"roi_bay_floor\",\n        \"polygon\": [\n          {\n            \"x\": 0.12,\n            \"y\": 0.25\n          },\n          {\n            \"x\": 0.88,\n            \"y\": 0.25\n          },\n          {\n            \"x\": 0.88,\n            \"y\": 0.92\n          },\n          {\n            \"x\": 0.12,\n            \"y\": 0.92\n          }\n        ],\n        \"sort_order\": 0,\n        \"meta\": null\n      }\n    ]\n  }\n}\n```\n\nOn publish, SCC also **POSTs this same `data` object** to `http://{device.config.api_url}:8600/rois` (see **Edge AI (Jetson ROI push)**)."
              },
              "response": [
                {
                  "name": "200 — device + active ROIs",
                  "originalRequest": {
                    "method": "GET",
                    "header": [
                      {
                        "key": "Accept",
                        "value": "application/json"
                      },
                      {
                        "key": "X-Device-Token",
                        "value": "{{deviceToken}}"
                      }
                    ],
                    "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/devices/{{deviceUuid}}/camera-rois"
                  },
                  "status": "OK",
                  "code": 200,
                  "_postman_previewlanguage": "json",
                  "header": [
                    {
