    {
      "name": "Edge AI (Jetson ROI push)",
      "description": "Outbound contract: **SCC → Jetson AI** on publish (DOC-23).\n\nNot an IR4 Laravel route — this is what the camera AI service must accept on the pole.\n\n| Pole | Host |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | `172.16.3.2` |\n| 2 | `172.16.2.2` |\n| 3 | `172.16.1.50` |\n| 4 | `172.16.4.2` |\n\nURL: `{{apiUrl}}` (= `device.config.api_url`, full endpoint including path).\nBody = same object as `GET /api/devices/{uuid}/camera-rois` → `data`.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "POST {api_url}",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"device\": {\n    \"id\": 3,\n    \"uuid\": \"7cd2d9bc-4986-4c07-9cd8-631a2eb66b02\",\n    \"reference\": \"DEV-CAM-FIXED-01\",\n    \"name\": \"Pole 01 Fixed Camera\"\n  },\n  \"view_fingerprint\": \"9f86d081884c7d659a2feaa0c55ad015a3bf4f1b2b0b822cd15d6c15b0f00a08\",\n  \"published_at\": \"2026-08-25T18:00:00+00:00\",\n  \"rois\": [\n    {\n      \"name\": \"Bay floor\",\n      \"reference\": \"roi_bay_floor\",\n      \"polygon\": [\n        {\n          \"x\": 0.12,\n          \"y\": 0.25\n        },\n        {\n          \"x\": 0.88,\n          \"y\": 0.25\n        },\n        {\n          \"x\": 0.88,\n          \"y\": 0.92\n        },\n        {\n          \"x\": 0.12,\n          \"y\": 0.92\n        }\n      ],\n      \"sort_order\": 0,\n      \"meta\": null\n    }\n  ]\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{apiUrl}}",
            "description": "SCC calls this when an operator **publishes** ROIs.\n\n**Auth:** none in v1 (LAN-only Jetson). Full URL from `device.config.api_url`.\n\n**Body:** identical to IR4 GET camera-rois `data` (device + view_fingerprint + published_at + rois).\n\nPole 1 example: `POST http://172.16.3.2:8600/rois`"
          },
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "200 — AI accepted ROIs",
              "originalRequest": {
                "method": "POST",
                "header": [
                  {
                    "key": "Accept",
                    "value": "application/json"
                  },
                  {
                    "key": "Content-Type",
                    "value": "application/json"
                  }
                ],
